# Waveshare ESP32-C5-Touch-LCD-2.8 board-specific sdkconfig overrides
# Layered on top of sdkconfig.defaults (the shared ESP32-C5 base config).
#
# Board: Waveshare ESP32-C5-Touch-LCD-2.8
# SoC:   ESP32-C5-WROOM-1-N8, 32 MB flash, 8 MB PSRAM, WiFi 6 dual-band
# Touch: CST3530 capacitive I2C (no calibration needed), interrupt GPIO5
# LCD:   ST7789 240x320, backlight via CH32V003 IO expander (I2C 0x24, EXIO_PWM)
# RF:    NM-RF-HAT via SD shim + JST wires (GPIO2/GPIO3 as control signals)
# Extra: QMI8658 IMU, SHTC3 temp/humidity, PCF85063A RTC, ES8311 audio codec
#
# Phase 2 — board on order (tracking 2026-09-07).
# Fill in once porting work begins.
#
# Key differences from NM-CYD-C5:
#   LCD CS:  GPIO10 (NM-CYD-C5 has LCD CS=23, SD CS=10)
#   SD CS:   GPIO23 (swapped)
#   SD MISO: GPIO8  (NM-CYD-C5 uses GPIO2)
#   Flash:   32 MB  (vs 16 MB on NM-CYD-C5)

# 32 MB flash (Waveshare has more flash than NM-CYD-C5)
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_32MB=y
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE="32MB"

# CONFIG_BOARD_WS_C5_28=y  (future Kconfig flag once board_hal Kconfig is wired)
